<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-05-10T02:14:24.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-e3af15c6-db18-4f12-958e-ef4b9480c6a7",
        "text": "Web pages can be so much more than just plain text! Imagine reading a long document with no pictures, no organized lists, and no way to jump to related information.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/2a6033fe6fc58e08c012341d0238ec83-intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-panel-1-1728a93a-a7fc-4d8d-a767-ab52b34c03ce.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-9665098d-53e4-4657-a987-3706eb8eb8a4",
        "text": "That's where images, lists, and links come in. They transform basic text into an engaging experience, making web pages informative and exciting!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/495af6d00eaec903255cc6b77125377e-intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-panel-2-a12a67e8-1fb2-437b-9767-eea63108d137.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-0e858032-14cc-4183-a930-6cfa43ea8b4b",
        "text": "Images add visual appeal and help explain complex ideas quickly. A single picture can convey a lot of information and make a page much more inviting.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b52f23583bae7a6e7835062a933c95fe-intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-panel-3-8f04db4a-69d0-481b-9707-7ba6bd146f8f.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-18841172-42a3-4f12-93cd-bdaaf49c6ac0",
        "text": "Lists organize information clearly, making it easy to scan and digest. Whether it's steps for a recipe or items to learn, lists guide your eyes and highlight important points.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/901426799d595e17ff17ec89ff8955cf-intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-panel-4-b3b6879d-2d6a-45c4-9e26-349a9abf6c20.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-aff8fd14-5ac8-403f-91f5-8e15ec955292",
        "text": "Links connect different parts of the web, letting you explore related topics or dive deeper into information with a single click. They make websites interactive and limitless!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b86c21e7a07aaaf8266681312841008e-intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-panel-5-5a221ed2-e12f-4664-ba54-0e8c1e9dd55c.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-0a1baa82-a31b-410f-815b-fe445430c29a",
        "text": "By combining these elements, you can create rich, dynamic web pages that are not only informative but also a joy to explore. Get ready to make your web content shine!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a964e1b307442537433907630a27ac2d-intro-unit1-lesson2-intro-enrichment-panel-6-13d73561-0ae9-4dc5-a225-94714ac49c7a.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Introduce the concept of enriching webpage content beyond basic text, explaining why images, lists, and links are important for making web pages more informative and engaging."
  },
  "published": true,
